        <div style="padding: 48px 44px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.55; font-size: 13px;">
          <!-- Header -->
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 22px; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;">
            <span>RIVERSIDE ALLOTMENTS — VOLUNTEER HANDBOOK (SAMPLE)</span>
            <span>SECTIONS 3 &amp; 4: ROTA AND TOOL SHED</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 3 -->
          <h2 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 4px; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">3. WATERING ROTA</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            Each volunteer waters every <strong>third evening</strong> during dry weeks. Swap with someone else if you cannot make your evening, and note the swap below.
          </p>

          <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin: 12px 0 18px 0;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="background-color: #f1f5f9; text-align: left;">
                <th style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600;">Evening</th>
                <th style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600;">Volunteer</th>
                <th style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 600;">Beds</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">Monday</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">A. Rivera</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">1 and 2</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">Wednesday</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">J. Okafor</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">2 and 3</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">Friday</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">S. Lindqvist</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 6px 10px;">3 and 4</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <!-- Section 4 -->
          <h2 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 4px; margin: 24px 0 10px 0;">4. TOOL SHED RULES</h2>
          <ul style="padding-left: 20px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <li>Return every tool clean and dry; brush soil off before it goes back on the hook.</li>
            <li>Sharpen what you borrow, or leave a note so the next volunteer knows.</li>
            <li>Log any breakage on the clipboard rather than quietly putting the tool back.</li>
          </ul>

          <div style="background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: #92400e;">
            <strong>Demo annotations:</strong> the DRAFT stamp and the sticky note in this sample are annotations, not part of the document. Hide or delete them from the Comments panel, or export a clean copy to leave them out entirely.
          </div>

          <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; margin-top: 120px;">
            Page 2 of 3 • Riverside Allotments Volunteer Handbook (sample document)
          </div>
        </div>
